profiles: prpl_core.yml: prplmesh-process-manager: fix getting debug information for the WiFi.

Previously getDebugInformation only collected debug information
for the enabled services, since the FEAT-27 some wifi services (pwhm,
prplmesh, wifi-sensing) are disabled and started via proces-manager.

This commit integrates changes to the prplmesh-process-manager to get
debug information for the all services under its control

Closes: PPW-2319
References: FEAT-27
